    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Moto kūfuma kūlī SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shikū jenījo a banhū bandya kūduguma, kūlwa nguno ya makoye ayo gakabagwīla; ū SEEBA ūwigwa ū būdugumi wabo ūsaya no. Moto gwika kūfuma kūlī SEEBA gūūbakenaagūla bamò na bamò abo baalī kū mhelo mhelo ya ng'hambī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū būnīlīīla ū Musa, nang'hwe ūnomba ū SEEBA, gūjima ū moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī lipandī lyenīlo litanwa gīkī Tabela,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tabela:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makūlū gaho, ipandī lya būpī.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nguno moto gwa kūfuma kūlī SEEBA gūkaligima hagatī gatī yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eemanu ūmo īlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baalī bajananījiwa ū ng'wibità, bandya kūhahaalīla shakūlya sha mbika jingī na jingī. Na a Baisilaeli būtwalanījiwa, nabo bandya hangī kwilīja līja balīhaya, “Yee gītī ūlū ni twayūūpandīka na tūnyama twa kūlya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ndīlo ja Misili najo twajikūmbūlile no, nguno ū kwenūko twalūjilyaga ndūhū nūūlū kūjifunīja sabo; būyaga na limbe, ndūūgwa, tigiti, shitūngūlū na shitūngūlū sumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūkūbūlagwa namba, ali īkī nduhu shikolo shingī, ūlū ītī eemanu īji dūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī eemanu jalī jibange gītī mbeke ja būsīga waape, alīyo ūmo jabonelagwa jalī na langi gītī būgondo wa mitī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a banhū bajaga bakūjisoleelaga, hūna baajisha h'iwe, nūūlū baajipūūla ng'witūlī. Hanuma baajizugaga mu nungū nūūlū kūbeeja keki. Ū kūjilya ū mu nomo, jabizaga gītī munhū alīīlya shilīwa shizugīlilwe maguta ga mizeituni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī eemanu jenījo jiyitaga a ha ng'hambī makanza gaa kūgwa lūme būjikū.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa kūnīlīīla SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūbigwa pye a banhū bakūlīlaga, būlī bene ha ng'hambī yabo, ūkoya no ū mu ng'holò; ū SEEBA ū ng'wene būmpelanya no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūng'wīla ū SEEBA, “Nibūlī wang'wītīlile makoye mataale gīkī ū ntūmami wako? Naakūkenije mhayo kī ūyo gwakūsayīkije gīko, nose ūniseseja nene pye a makoye ga banhū benaba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene hū nakabatungīla nda a banhū benaba? Nūūlū ū nene hū nalī myaji wabo? Nibūlī ūkūniwīlaga nabalele mu nkono gwane, gītī neji wa ng'wana ng'weleele, nabatwale kū sī īyo bebe ng'wenekīlī wabisagīja bakūlūgenji babo, nīyo ūbilahīlīla, gīkī ūkūbinha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī īkī bakwikalaga būnilīlīīla balīhaya, ‘Twinhage nyama ja kūlya’; ū nene nakūjipandīkīla halī ī nyama ja kūbalyisha pye a banhū benaba? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natūdūla ū kūbabūūcha iyene a banhū a bose aba; ū nigo gūlī ndito no, gūlīnibuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūnanukūlile ū miso gako alīyo hangī hū ūlīnīītīla mihayo gītī yenīyī, īlī hambū hambū ūnibūlage wangū kūtinda kūnileka nabūbone ū būbi ūbo būlanigwīle.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ishosho lya ng'wa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa, “Nenhelage banahala makūmi mpungatī kūfuma ū mu Baisilaeli, abo ūbamanile gīkī balī batongeeji na bataale ū mu banhū. Bawīlge bize ū kwiheema lya kwibilingīla, bize bimīīle hamò nang'ho koi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakwika nize ho nayombe ning'we, hama ī nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo ījo jilī mulī bebe nakūjisola jimò nabinhe nabo ī nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo. Na lūūlū bakūbiza hamò nang'ho ū mu kūgūbūūcha ū nigo gwa kūbagunanha a banhū, ūtizikala ūgūbūūkije bebe iyene dūhū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bawīlage a banhū, “Būlī ng'wene wiyeeje ng'wenekīlī kūlwa lūshikū lwa ntondo; nguno mukūlya nyama. Ū SEEBA wang'wigwile ūmo mukūlīlīlaga gīkī, ‘Yee gītī ūlū ni twayūūpandīka na tūnyama twa kūlya! Twalī hambū hambū aho twalī Misili!’ Na lūūlū ī haha ū SEEBA akūng'winha nyama ja kūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutūūgelela kūjilya lūshikū lūmò dūhū, nūūlū shikū ibīlī nūūlū itanò, nūūlū ikūmi, nūūlū makūmi abīlī dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo mukūjilya ng'weji ngima, kūshisha jimukole muyūjibbīzūka jafumīla na mu mūūlū ging'we; nguno ng'wanemile ū SEEBA ūyo alī hamò ning'we. Mukwikalaga ng'ūlīla mulīhaya gīkī, ‘Nibūlī tūkīnga ī Misili.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa akang'wīla ū SEEBA, Ūlīhaya gīkī, “Nakūbinha nyama ja kūlya kūshisha ng'weji ngima gūshile; alīyo a bagosha dūhū abo badūgije kūshimīza na magūlū gabo bashikile shihūmbī magana atandatū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bahnhū benaba badūgije kūpandīka nyama ja kūbigela, nūūlū bakasīnzīlwa madaale na madaale ga ng'holo na ga ng'ombe? Nūūlū jikazuwa pyī ī ndīlo ja mu nyanza jikūbigela?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū SEEBA ūnshokeja ū Musa alīhaya, “Bebe ū nkono go ng'wa SEEBA gūlī nguhī no? Ūkwiloleela lūūlū, ūbone ūlū gīkī īyo nalīkūwīla nalīhaya dūhū, nūūlū nakūmushikīlīgīja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Banamhala makūmi mpungatī na babīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūja ū kū banhū, ūūkabawīla īyo īkahayiwa na SEEBA. Ūsola banamhala makūmi mpugatī kūfuma mubo, wiza wīmīīla nabo kūlīpīndya ī liheema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū SEEBA wika mu shiikolile sh'ilunde, hamò na lyochi; ūsola nguzu jimò ja ng'wa Moyo kūfuma a halī Musa, ūbatūūlīla nabo a banamhala abo makūmi mpungatī ī nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo. Aho wabikalīla ū Moyo būhanga ikanza iguhī, gwike batagwītile hangī ū mhayo gwenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū ng'hambī baalī basaaga bagosha babīlī, mina gabo Elidadi na Medadi; nabo a mina gabo gaalī gandīkwa hamò na a ga bichabo, gwike būleka ū kūja ū kwiheema. Alīyo na a boi akabikalīla ū Moyo, bandya kūhanga aho balī ū kū ng'hambī kwenūko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndinha nebe ūpeela ū kūlī Musa ūūkang'wīla, “A ba Elidadi nū Medadi balīhanga ū kū ng'hambī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yoshwa, ū ngunanhibo ng'wa Musa kūfuma walūki bokwe ūyomba, “Baba Musa bahamage!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Musa ūshosha alīhaya, “Bebe wanīītīla wilu shi ī gete? Ū nene ī ng'hūmbū jane jilī gīkī pye a banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA babize bahangi, na gīkī ū SEEBA abatūūlīle Moyo wakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa na a banhamhala ba Baisilaeli būshoka ū kū ng'hambī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu kūtūma nzūūlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla ū SEEBA watūma lūyaga, lwiza lūkūlajaga nzūūlī kūfuma kū nyanza. Jiza jūūgwa jiyīpīndīlīgije pyī ī ng'hambī; jūlamatīla a hasī. Jiitūlīīla kūshisha gītī miita īmò ū kūja ū ng'wigūlya; ali ū bū kūle ū kūfuma a ha ng'hambī, pyī ī mhande jose jose, lūgendo lwa kūshimīza lūshikū lūgima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū pye ū lūshikū lwenūlo nū būjikū waho, na a ha ntondo; a banhū baalī hanze bakūsoleelaga nzūūlī dūhū. Walī atīho nūūlū ūmò wa kūsola ha sīlīlī ya madebbe igana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Madebbe igana:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, Homeli 10 Shiswahili sha Zanziba, Flasila 100; falasila imò gitī budito bo shipimo ikūmi na shitandatū, hihī latili 35 nūūlū 36.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hūna būjanikīla pye a hose a ha ng'hambī bīpīndīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho bataalī ū kūjimala ū kūjilya, ū būpelanubo ng'wa SEEBA būbapembekela a banhū, ūbagwisīja ikūla lyabūbi no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī lipandī lyenīlo līkitanwa lina lya Kibloti Hataava; nguno a henaho bakabajīīka a banhū abo baalī bikūmva shilīīwa shambika yīngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bīnga ī Kibloti Hataava, būshimīza kūja Hazelooti, būūkikala kwenūko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
